    <!--
        Third-party brand marks as vector geometry.

        Fluent's SymbolRegular set is a UI icon library, not a logo library: it has no GitHub or LinkedIn
        mark, and there is no sensible native stand-in for a specific company's logo. So the marks are
        drawn here as paths instead.

        Both are authored on their own coordinate system (GitHub on 16x16, LinkedIn on 24x24). Draw them
        with Stretch="Uniform" and an explicit Width/Height and the difference does not matter.

        These are trademarks of their owners, used here only to label links pointing at those services.
    -->

